    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A blast from the past from our beloved artist Doxy. Hazel is a turnip farmer by day and a witch student by night! With the help of her beloved, but grumpy, master Monty she practices every day in order to be able to enroll into a prestigious magical school. But Hazel has one small, tini-tiny <strong>idiosyncrasy</strong>, for some reason our heroine always adds <strong>Penis and Breasts</strong> to any object she touches or cast magic at, even causing the turnips she picks up to be phallic shaped (she calls them <strong>Durnips</strong>). How can our heroine pass the magic school exam? Do durnips sell better than turnips for lonely housewives? Why is there a millennial demon awakening in her backyard? Find out all the answers in <strong>Hazel &amp; The Deep!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Remaster from the web game comes extra shiny and with new improvements!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GALLERY MODE:</strong> A quick access to all the smut and artwork made by your favorite artist Doxy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ANIMATIONS: </strong>All of Doxy character art animated! (Specially the Jiggly bits)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FULLY VOICED: </strong>Who needs to read when you have our talented VA giving life to our great and deep characters?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>QoL: </strong>Saving, cloud saving, achievements, display support, you name it! All to help you get the best experience in this high-jinx filled comedy horror!</p></li></ul>",
